    "version": "2.1.296",
    "purpose": "The request with no tools and 1 message asks for a session title. Its output schema has only a title property, and the first prompt is in its user message.",
    "skip_condition": "Claude Code skips the title request if CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_TERMINAL_TITLE is set, or if essential traffic mode is on. In print mode (CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT sdk-cli), it also skips it if CLAUDE_AGENT_SDK_VERSION is not set and no remote session is named, but only while a server-side feature flag allows the skip.",
    "consequence": "In a plain terminal, print mode sent no title request in this capture, but a change of the server-side flag can turn the request on. So the relay refuses print mode in each environment, unless CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_TERMINAL_TITLE is true."
  },
